{"step_index":502,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T17:54:44Z","input_tokens":3351,"cache_read_tokens":183184,"output_tokens":2387,"thinking":"The interface appears to be a central control panel for a fitness gym, displaying real-time metrics and various management features. The sidebar suggests functionalities for access control, point of sale, customer management, inventory, and financial tracking. This implies the system is designed for comprehensive gym operations management.\n\n\nCleaning the \"accesos directos\" folder is required to eliminate redundant or blocked shortcuts and consolidate essential application launchers. Batch files are redundant when an executable is available. OneDrive is blocking direct `.lnk` shortcuts, so those will be removed. The goal is to simplify and ensure direct access to applications and the clean web client.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"# 1. Clean up diagnostic/temporary files in gym root\n$tempFiles = @(\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\test_diagnose.js\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\test_diagnose_auth.js\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\test_diagnose_packaged.js\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\test_login_roberto.js\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\test_verify_erp.js\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\diagnose.log\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\diagnose_authenticated.log\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\diagnose_login_roberto.log\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\diagnose_packaged.log\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\diagnose_verify_erp.log\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\diagnose_screen.png\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\diagnose_after_login.png\",\n    \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\diagnose_after_robe